{"_id":"68a736318ec3d8323af1ce0a","nodeId":"dgoDNDtW2_q9R9yhkXrcz","roadmapSlug":"react","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:28.899Z","description":"# useCallback\n\n`useCallback` is a React hook that returns a memoized version of a callback function. It's used to optimize performance by preventing unnecessary re-renders. Specifically, it helps avoid recreating functions when their dependencies haven't changed, which can be useful when passing callbacks to child components that rely on referential equality to prevent re-rendering.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"React Documentation on useCallback","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/useCallback","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1b7"},{"type":"article","title":"useCallback Explained in Depth","url":"https://kentcdodds.com/blog/usememo-and-usecallback","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1b8"},{"type":"article","title":"useCallback Hook: An Introductory Guide","url":"https://dmitripavlutin.com/dont-overuse-react-usecallback/","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1b9"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:25:49.234Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163ae","title":"Scrimba - Advanced React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/advanced-react-c02h?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163fe","title":"Scrimba - Build a Movie Search App in React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-a-movie-search-app-in-react-c0u?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d041644e","title":"Scrimba - Build Tic Tac Toe with React Hooks","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-tic-tac-toe-with-react-hooks-c0m?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/react/content/dgoDNDtW2_q9R9yhkXrcz.md"}